ui-ux-pro-max-php
=================

This skill folder is a PHP port ("fork") of the "ui-ux-pro-max" Agent Skill.

Upstream project:  nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill
Upstream URL:      https://github.com/nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill
Upstream license:  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024 Next Level Builder

What is derived from the upstream project
-----------------------------------------
* Everything under `data/` (the CSV design database and the catalog-summary.json /
  data-provenance.json manifests) is copied/ported from the upstream `data/` directory.
  Two large upstream catalogs are intentionally OMITTED from this fork to keep it lean:
  `phosphor-icons-upstream.json` and `google-font-licenses.json`.
* `scripts/search.php` is a port of the upstream Python search engine
  (`scripts/core.py` + `scripts/search.py`): the same CSV_CONFIG domain mapping, the same
  BM25 ranking, tokenization, domain auto-detection, query rewrites, score thresholds, and
  output formatting. It is a derivative work.

What is original to this fork
-----------------------------
* `data/stacks/tiger-php.csv` — Tiger/TigerZF (PHP) stack guidance, authored for this fork
  on the upstream stack-CSV schema.
* The PHP implementation itself (`scripts/search.php`) and this SKILL.md/NOTICE.

